'''Loading dock 23''' was a bay of the [[Colossus loading docks|''Colossus'' loading docks]].<ref name="DangerousBusiness" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="DBDate">{{ResistanceDate|1|13}}</ref> [[Resistance]] [[spy]] [[Kazuda Xiono]] was nearly [[assassin]]ated by [[First Order]] spy [[Teroj Kee]] after the latter individual ordered dock worker [[Glem]] to drop his locker&mdash;which Xiono was trapped inside&mdash;into the [[Ocean|waters]] of [[Castilon]] below. However, Xiono was able to escape.<ref name="DangerousBusiness" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Loading dock 23 appeared in "[[Dangerous Business]],"<ref name="DangerousBusiness" /> the thirteenth episode of ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'s'' [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|first season]], which premiered on [[Disney Channel]] on [[January 20]], [[2019]].<ref name="Airdates">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref>

